Let me look at the actual model config for the tts agent. Looking at the config I got, the tts agent has:
```json
{
  "id": "tts",
  "model": "minimax/MiniMax-M2.7",
  ...
}
```

But the model field is just a string "minimax/MiniMax-M2.7", it doesn't have per-model config like maxTokens.

Looking at the defaults section:
```json
"defaults": {
  "model": {
    "fallbacks": [...],
    "primary": "minimax/MiniMax-M2.7"
  },
  "models": {
    "minimax/MiniMax-M2.5": {}
  }
}
```

The models under defaults are empty objects. Maybe I can set maxTokens there.

Let me try patching `agents.defaults.models.minimax/MiniMax-M2.7` with maxTokens: 8192.

